ColorOS Enhance / ColorOS 增强

Research and adaptation reference:
  OShin by suqi8 and contributors
  https://github.com/suqi8/OShin
  GNU Affero General Public License v3.0

The installed OShin 16.14.1912 (1455) APK and this device's OEM frameworks
were inspected to identify behavior and method signatures. The standalone
implementation adapts that behavior to PHY110 / Android 17, uses a different
package and settings group, and includes the complete buildable source.

This project is provided under AGPL-3.0-or-later; see LICENSE.
It does not redistribute the original OShin APK, OEM system JARs, user
framework databases, or signing keys.

Build dependencies include io.github.libxposed:api:102.0.0 (compile only)
and io.github.libxposed:service:102.0.0. Their respective upstream notices
and licenses remain applicable.

